 "name": "Volkswagen, Skoda (Raise / Oudi, PQ)",
 "description": "Raise (RZC) or Oudi box, older Volkswagen / Skoda (PQ platforms), from the decoder Hiworld's own app uses for these boxes (RePQProtocol); the cars are the ones that app decodes with it. The head unit says hello once (0x81 01) and acknowledges each message (FF); no car type. Not tried on a car yet.",
 "box": "raise",
 "baud": 38400,
